Third-party attribution for terraform-multicloud-orchestrator

Attribution: the failure-mode-first methodology is inspired by TerraShark
(github.com/LukasNiessen/terrashark, MIT). The diagnose-first routing and
response-contract structure are inspired by Anton Babenko's terraform-skill
(github.com/antonbabenko/terraform-skill, Apache-2.0). All reference content
in this repository is original.

The file assets/azurerm-5-changes.json in the skill lists resource type and
argument names taken from the 5.0 upgrade guide of the Terraform provider for
Azure (github.com/hashicorp/terraform-provider-azurerm, MPL-2.0). It holds
names only, not the guide's text.
